<title>PAKISTAN: Four killed in bomb blast in Pakistani town.</title>
<headline>Four killed in bomb blast in Pakistani town.</headline>
<dateline>LAHORE, Pakistan 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A bomb exploded in a bus in the Pakistani city of Sialkot, in Punjab province, on Monday morning, killing at least four people, police said.</p>
<p>No other details were immediately available.</p>
